// THE decisive check. How many DISTINCT users signed in from each address?
// An IP shared by dozens of users is corporate egress and is not an anomaly,
// whatever its GeoIP says. An IP used by exactly one user is worth the next
// query. Placeholders: {IPS} = quoted, comma-separated list.
AzureSigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where IPAddress in ({IPS})
| summarize users = dcount(UserPrincipalName), events = count(),
            firstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), lastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)
    by IPAddress
| order by events desc
